  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf you control a \"Superheavy Samurai\" monster:
    You can add 1 \"Superheavy Samurai Soul\" monster from your Deck to your hand.
    You can only use this effect of \"Superheavy Samurai Monk Big Benkei\" once per
    turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf you have no Spells/Traps in your GY: You can
    send 1 \"Superheavy Samurai Big Benkei\" from your hand or Deck to the GY, and
    if you do, Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is used as Synchro
    Material and added to your Extra Deck face-up: You can place this card in your
    Pendulum Zone. You can only use each effect of \"Superheavy Samurai Monk Big
    Benkei\" once per turn."
